 \subsection{Pilot Testing and Parameter Checks}
-Before confirmatory recruitment, pilot sessions will verify the realized angle/height schedules, target visibility and seated comfort, readiness and selection behavior, gaze validity, audio timing and wording, and reconstruction of trial events from the saved data. Survey comprehension and completion time will also be measured. Calibration acceptance, practice proficiency, timeout and technical-stop criteria will be set from those checks and recorded with the study build and questionnaire versions. Pilot observations will be reported as such rather than presented as study outcomes or evidence for a voice-condition effect.
+Before confirmatory recruitment, pilot sessions will verify the realized angle/height schedules, target visibility and seated comfort, readiness and selection behavior, gaze validity, audio timing and wording, and reconstruction of trial events from the saved data. Survey comprehension and completion time will also be measured. Calibration acceptance, practice proficiency and technical-stop criteria will be set from those checks; the suitability of the selected 15-second deadline will also be assessed and documented with the study build and questionnaire versions. Pilot observations will be reported as such rather than presented as study outcomes or evidence for a voice-condition effect.
